sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PA as Power Automate<br/>(or Graph poll)
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant SVC as Cloud Run<br/>new-deal-review-agent
    participant TQ as Cloud Tasks<br/>ndra-advance
    participant AS as Asana
    participant SF as Salesforce
    participant SP as SharePoint

    Note over PA,SP: Workflow 1 - Purchase Acknowledgement email to populated task + document pack

    PA->>GW: POST /events/mail (x-api-key, HMAC headers)
    GW->>SVC: forward with OIDC token
    SVC->>SVC: verify HMAC + timestamp, filter by sender and subject,<br/>read quote number from the email

    alt no quote number found
        SVC-->>PA: 422, log error, alert (no task exists to flag)
    else quote number found
        SVC->>TQ: enqueue task, name derived from the Outlook message id
        SVC-->>PA: 202 Accepted (fast, no stage work done here)
    end

    Note right of PA: Graph polling alternative: Cloud Scheduler calls /jobs/poll,<br/>which re-reads recent mail and enqueues the same way

    TQ->>SVC: POST /internal/advance (OIDC)

    SVC->>AS: find task by Quote Number (include completed tasks)
    alt task already exists
        AS-->>SVC: task gid, fields, Agent stages
        Note right of SVC: repeat delivery: skip every stage whose<br/>evidence is already present
    else no task yet
        SVC->>SF: SOQL on the quote - account, description, dates
        SF-->>SVC: quote fields
        SVC->>AS: create task in the Deal Review Tracker<br/>(resolve annual project, write only empty fields)
        AS-->>SVC: task gid
        SVC->>AS: Agent stages = task_created
    end

    Note over SVC,SP: Track A - signed quote only, this is the critical path

    SVC->>SF: list files attached to the quote and agreements
    SF-->>SVC: ContentVersion list
    SVC->>SVC: pick the executed (signed) quote by object and title
    SVC->>SF: download signed quote PDF
    SVC->>SP: ensure path customer / New Deals / <month>, upload
    SVC->>AS: Agent stages += signed_quote_in

    Note right of SVC: amendment analysis can start NOW.<br/>It needs nothing else from the pack.

    Note over SVC,SP: Track B - rest of the pack, best effort, never blocks

    SVC->>SVC: classify remaining files - TAF / PO / master agreement<br/>(object and title match first)
    SVC->>SF: download matched files
    Note right of SF: all documents are attached at<br/>Closed/Won, so this is normally<br/>a single pass, not a chase
    SVC->>SP: upload (skip files already present)
    SP-->>SVC: item ids

    alt pack complete
        SVC->>AS: Agent stages += pack_complete
    else something missing
        SVC->>AS: Agent stages += pack_partial, comment naming the missing documents
        Note right of AS: enrichment and the DRS proceed regardless
    end

    alt any stage failed
        SVC-->>TQ: 5xx, Cloud Tasks retries with backoff, redoing only that stage
        Note right of TQ: on the last attempt the handler sets needs_human,<br/>comments on the task, alerts, and returns 200
    else all stages done
        SVC-->>TQ: 200, task removed from the queue
    end
